{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>衛詩雅早前拍攝劇集《狩謊》期間發生意外，不幸被玻璃碎片割傷左上唇，傷口涉及皮膚及唇紅部位，及致有一條血管斷裂與肌肉撕裂，當時出血量較多，屬於全層撕裂創傷，需即時接受縫針手術，傷口總共縫合了50多針。</p><p>今日衛詩雅出席北京白花頒獎禮，見到她上唇位置貼上膠布，不過整體看來已恢復得七七八八，依然keep到靚樣，相信各位粉絲可以放心。</p><figure><img alt=\"衛詩雅上唇縫50多針後首露面。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163544596534398976137806.jpeg/zeGB_NlHQ20vOC_m8fEdThtQ4sGHfegBLQX_Ay0F_wM\"/><figcaption>衛詩雅上唇縫50多針後首露面。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"衛詩雅上唇縫50多針後首露面。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163544593455648768295143.jpeg/tr9DZBnhQGoTJid1XE4dfbp6y2-VSXhcHZ3LNB2dyzQ\"/><figcaption>衛詩雅上唇縫50多針後首露面。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷口貼上膠布。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163544607238656000791328.jpeg/DPZGUOHGOvBIqZAMBF169iNmRR71_mzaA8GZ1gPBmdY\"/><figcaption>傷口貼上膠布。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷口貼上膠布。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163544603857915904972801.jpeg/zflub81l4qTu8bD1SqrIlFeT5OIF4Ezj5fDgC-Xw4As\"/><figcaption>傷口貼上膠布。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"未影響靚樣。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163544600833691648490671.jpeg/09Joh6sxPNxh1dpsRfeI3qSdGDDXnhGRCu72aAru9mg\"/><figcaption>未影響靚樣。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"未影響靚樣。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163544597943685120816942.jpeg/VgH7Wr5AlYCoFASOMJhyqXPu5Wz3LEJLYpHUb2KR1G8\"/><figcaption>未影響靚樣。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀態極佳。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163544594852352000143802.jpeg/EoMR5aXeFlf8_3EJoizjPfzvKaLlXnqD0-7cJtPu3CY\"/><figcaption>狀態極佳。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T10:04:34.113842+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}